{
  "title": "Feelings and opinions",
  "note": "Many feelings use the dative case (the \"to whom\" case): Podoba mi się (I like how it looks), Smakuje mi (it tastes good to me), Zimno mi (I'm cold). Dative pronouns: mi, ci, mu (him), jej, nam, wam, im. Nouns: feminine -a → -e/-i (mama → mamie), masculine often -owi (bratu and ojcu are exceptions). Feeling adjectives agree: zmęczony (m), zmęczona (f).",
